OL,3,AAmazon plane crash scene 'devastating',
OL,4,Asays investigator as data and voice
OL,5,Arecorders recovered
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe scene of the Amazon cargo plane
OL,8,Fcrash has been described as
OL,9,F"devastating" by an investigator
OL,11,FJennifer Homendy, chair of the
OL,12,Fregulator the National Transportation
OL,13,FSafety Board, says there is "debris
OL,14,Feverywhere" after the aircraft overshot
OL,15,Fthe runway at Miami International
OL,16,FAirport (MIA) on Sunday, killing five
OL,18,FShe says the priority is the recovery
OL,19,Fof the victims, and investigators will
OL,20,Fbe looking at factors such as flight
OL,21,Fhistory and weather conditions
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
