OL,3,AAmazon plane crash scene 'devastating',
OL,4,Asays investigator as data and voice
OL,5,Arecorders recovered
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe plane - with two crew members - hit
OL,8,Fa white Ford van carrying seven people,
OL,9,Fand a Toyota car travelling on 67th
OL,10,FAvenue
OL,12,FTwo of MIA's four runways remain closed
OL,13,Fon Monday as passengers are warned of
OL,14,Ffurther disruption
